      "message": "Adding the other OUT_OF_KEYS_* errors here is actually incorrect, because this method should only return true when we need to consider `mRkpdStatus`. However, `mRkpdStatus` is obsolete as of API 34.\n\nIt was actually a mistake to include the new \"require upgrade\" status in this method.\n\nIn U, we will drop `mRkpdStatus` as we\u0027re getting the info we need directly in `mErrorCode`. I\u0027ve started the cleanup in this change by removing this method. This way, folks can just look for `\\bOUT_OF_KEYS\\b` and remove it once we make the permanent swap to rkpd.\n\nAll the special-case handling for OUT_OF_KEYS is obsolete and we can start to remove it.",
